      "statement": "Bookmark is a dataclass with required id:int and url:str and defaulted title:str=\"\", tags:List[str]=[], and created_at:str (UTC ISO timestamp via datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat()); from_dict requires id and url (KeyError if absent) and falls back to safe defaults for the rest.",
