      "statement": "Bookmark.matches_tag, matches_any_tag, and matches_all_tags perform case-sensitive membership checks against self.tags with no normalization; matches_any_tag is OR semantics, matches_all_tags is AND semantics. None are currently called by CLI or API except matches_tag.",
